{\plain It is convenient to measure the 
performance of this communication scheme
 by the criterion of mean-square error, 
MSE, of the estimate. It can be difficult
 to define a signal-to-noise ratio at the
 system output because, if the input signal-to-noise
 ratio is small, there is no component of
 the output identifiable as "signal"!}
}
