{\plain Recall that log(FM)=0 (FM=1) is 
attained by merely always taking the zero
 sequence as the estimate! Note that, as
 the SNR decreases from high values, there
 is a fairly linear decrease in performance
 until the SNR is about 10 db. Then, in 
the range 10 db to 0 db,  the performance
 degenerates to hardly better than guessing
 zero- that is, shutting off the receiver!!}
}
